@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = pega-aqui-tu-API_TOKEN
@user = Tu nombre
@clientId = 1

### Comprobar que la aplicación responde
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Ver la lista de clientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User: {{user}}

### Ver la ficha de un cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User: {{user}}

### Ver el historial de un cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{clientId}}/historico
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User: {{user}}
